            <div xml:id="d900">

                <pb facs="0936" n="824" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg824"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 891.001.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Shah of Persia to the
                            President of the United States.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-09-30"><hi rendition="#italic">September 30,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I beg you, Mr. President, to accept my earnest thanks for the condolence you were
                    so good as to send me on the occasion of the death of the Regent Azedolmolk.</p>
                <p>In the name of His Majesty the Shah:</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mostofiolmemalek</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">President of Council.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
